abstract: "Reproducible research prototype for predicting overall and progression-free survival under chemotherapy from baseline clinical variables of a phase 3 oncology trial (NCT00119613, Project Data Sphere): Cox proportional hazards, random survival forest and XGBoost with anti-leakage cross-validation, calibration, robustness and interpretability analyses, and a synthetic-data privacy study (CTGAN, TSTR, membership inference, k-anonymity, DCR). Code of the bachelor's thesis for the BSc in Applied Data Science, Universitat Oberta de Catalunya, 2026. Academic prototype; not a clinical device."
